From d8a781b5616bdb8535cc0ced76533a454b538631 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZonicExists <71136987+zonicisalive@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:59:57 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 06/37] bitproxy: app picker with VPN/Direct switch per app and
 clone

Lists apps with icons, search and a system-apps filter. Each app, clone
(user 999) and other user copy is its own row; apps sharing a uid are
one row. Choices are saved by package + user id and resolved to live
uids on every scan: PackageManager for the current user plus
'pm list packages -U' (as conf-merger.py did) for clones, with a manual
'Add clone' fallback that computes userId * 100000 + appId. VpnService
include/exclude lists are not used.
